  "answer": "I couldn't find a past ticket reporting this exact problem: Power Display switching the active profile after the laptop wakes from sleep. Related tickets exist but describe different problems. PowerToys#48774 is about a profile linked to Light Switch not being applied on wake. PowerToys#47599 is about monitor settings (visible controls) resetting after restart or wake. Neither covers the active profile changing to a different one on wake. Please keep this ticket open as a new report and attach a PowerToys bug report ZIP. Include your dock and monitor setup (USB-C dock, two monitors) and whether the profile change also happens when the monitors are simply turned off and on. Until it is fixed, you may need to re-select your dimmed profile after waking the laptop."
